    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_CeladonCity_Condominiums_1F_Text_Nidoran",
      "en_US": "Nidoran♀: Kya kyaoo!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_CeladonCity_Condominiums_1F_Text_TryThisDrinkInstead",
      "en_US": [
        "You shouldn’t spend all your money\n",
        "on drinks.\r",
        "Try this instead."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_CeladonCity_Condominiums_1F_Text_NothingBeatsThirstLikeTea",
      "en_US": [
        "Nothing beats thirst like some hot\n",
        "Tea.\r",
        "It really is the best."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_PaintWorld_Text_FigureFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "A figure made of paint turns to\n",
        "face you. It raises a brush."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_CeladonCity_Condominiums_1F_Text_ManagersSuite",
      "en_US": [
        "Celadon Mansion\n",
        "Manager’s Suite"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_CeladonCity_Condominiums_1F_Text_MyDearMonsKeepMeCompany",
      "en_US": [
        "My dear Pokémon keep me company.\n",
        "Meowth even brings money home!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_CeladonCity_Condominiums_1F_Text_DaisyComesToBuyTea",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hello, dearie.\n",
        "Did you enjoy my Tea?\r",
        "By the way, dear. Are you, by any\n",
        "chance, from Pallet Town?\r",
        "A girl from Pallet Town, Daisy,\n",
        "she enjoys Tea every day.\r",
        "She visits the Celadon Dept. Store\n",
        "to buy some Tea."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_gText_TooBadBagIsFull",
      "en_US": [
        "Too bad!\n",
        "The Bag is full…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_PaintWorld_Text_FigureSketch",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure’s colors swirl.\n",
        "It’s waiting for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_PaintWorld_Text_FigureMega",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure is holding a stone that\n",
        "shines in every color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_PaintWorld_Text_Dissolve",
      "en_US": [
        "The figure runs like wet paint…\n",
        "The world around it does too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0501_T07R0201_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMove",
